{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the Greed</strong> is a short, minimalistic <strong>incremental game</strong> about tiny skeleton villagers sacrificing creatures to satiate their greed for essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be finished in one sitting\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takes about an hour to a few of hours to finish depending on your choices, strategy and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intended to be played actively</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/d8b7bfa39d6962073ffe98fbbd841cd0.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assign villagers to different buildings, generating offerings to be sacrificed to a mysterious space rift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ebdf1b02e793b9b59ea6c3ca5e4b4a09.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ac96df83c2824b205e464948730e96a7.apng?t=1758300236\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ac96df83c2824b205e464948730e96a7.poster.avif?t=1758300236\" class=\"bb_img\" width=624 height=52 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As your villagers lead the offerings to the space rift, it rewards them with essence. Providing enough offerings causes the space rift to grow, granting a <i>pure essence</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/6f6bcbd877b7dcd18f697bb1e7fa3a27.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <i>pure essence</i> to build different buildings, which will produce better offerings, accumulating more essence faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/3706ad091b9598f6156a4270e6b56bac.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use essence and <i>pure essence</i> to improve your offerings - like higher essence yield or unique effects. Some upgrades allow offerings to interact with each other, creating unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Pixel Font: Adventurer by Brian J Smith - CC-BY)</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ouch!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/a718051909e600ff19f3f7c855f16e7dbf8c4491.jpg"},{"name":"Daydream","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/8b7b27450f20105dff6fe27e15f5fc301cd05301.jpg"},{"name":"Show Them Some Love - Villager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/5ca2d96b9c0538310217ad09d90aac3eb936e0e6.jpg"},{"name":"Show Them Some Love - Slime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/2c0f2beb53146ba0a8674de33c44c7b83849511a.jpg"},{"name":"Show Them Some Love - Sheep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/6c575637bec2c4303eb580ae73485db291ad277c.jpg"},{"name":"Show Them Some Love - Bat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/991b2836f46334099cb7183387b6cde09bb7a44a.jpg"},{"name":" Show Them Some Love - Ogre","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/10866d08a988ea2423bc846fad0509bb1ac6db34.jpg"},{"name":"Show Them Some Love - Villager Offering","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/daa4b0b0b496080fe0a2c80970c34853b86c15f0.jpg"},{"name":" Show Them Some Love - Fanatic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/2ba573a9a3da189728e378ebe7c32ce8d0b81052.jpg"},{"name":"Consumed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3950280/88128965bc3b452b4fe36af9640979bae6769187.jpg"}],"total":22},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950280?t=1758300236","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950280?t=1758300236","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/e796cc53a0c25078c432f6f950e8f1b181eb42d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758300236","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/e796cc53a0c25078c432f6f950e8f1b181eb42d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758300236","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the Greed</strong> is a short, minimalistic <strong>incremental game</strong> about tiny skeleton villagers sacrificing creatures to satiate their greed for essence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be finished in one sitting\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takes about an hour to a few of hours to finish depending on your choices, strategy and playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intended to be played actively</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/d8b7bfa39d6962073ffe98fbbd841cd0.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assign villagers to different buildings, generating offerings to be sacrificed to a mysterious space rift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ebdf1b02e793b9b59ea6c3ca5e4b4a09.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ac96df83c2824b205e464948730e96a7.apng?t=1758300236\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/ac96df83c2824b205e464948730e96a7.poster.avif?t=1758300236\" class=\"bb_img\" width=624 height=52 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As your villagers lead the offerings to the space rift, it rewards them with essence. Providing enough offerings causes the space rift to grow, granting a <i>pure essence</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/6f6bcbd877b7dcd18f697bb1e7fa3a27.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <i>pure essence</i> to build different buildings, which will produce better offerings, accumulating more essence faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/extras/3706ad091b9598f6156a4270e6b56bac.avif?t=1758300236\" width=800 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use essence and <i>pure essence</i> to improve your offerings - like higher essence yield or unique effects. Some upgrades allow offerings to interact with each other, creating unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Pixel Font: Adventurer by Brian J Smith - CC-BY)</i></p>","developers":["Elifam"],"dlc":[3994740],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950280/7353c16868bb00c537da366f1e4d903a0d98f454/header.jpg?t=1758300236","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3950280/1975793767/644d37855f7cf8b0298cd577ccfd27b77e6e17a